1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,308
Sixteen days after the world shut down,
the Pentagon already had a suspect.

2
00:00:04,628 --> 00:00:06,486
March twenty-seventh, twenty twenty.

3
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:10,522
The Defense Intelligence Agency circulates
an Authoritative Assessment.

4
00:00:10,642 --> 00:00:13,055
Not to the public. To its own analysts.

5
00:00:13,355 --> 00:00:17,600
The subject: one lab in Wuhan. One
researcher. Three quiet facts.

6
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:20,363
The lab kept a bank of bat coronaviruses.

7
00:00:20,463 --> 00:00:22,972
Its scientists could build infectious
clones.

8
00:00:23,072 --> 00:00:25,836
And they had already engineered chimeric
spike genes.

9
00:00:26,196 --> 00:00:29,944
June twenty twenty. Pentagon medical
intelligence runs the genome.

10
00:00:30,084 --> 00:00:32,938
Three scientists reach a conclusion.
Manipulated.

11
00:00:33,278 --> 00:00:37,061
August twenty twenty-one. The President is
briefed on COVID's origin.

12
00:00:37,221 --> 00:00:40,090
That conclusion, reportedly, never enters
the room.

13
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:46,336
Now the honest part. These assessments
carry low confidence. Most scientists
still say nature.

14
00:00:46,536 --> 00:00:49,367
Fine. Because the strange part was never
the virus.

15
00:00:49,607 --> 00:00:53,831
The answer sat in a drawer for six years.
It took a court order to open it.

16
00:00:54,331 --> 00:00:56,027
The question was never what happened.

17
00:00:56,307 --> 00:00:57,376
It's who already knew.

18
00:00:58,076 --> 00:00:59,122
Twenty twenty-seven.
